{# --- Draft/Edit mode --- #}
Save results by calling **Simulation_Draft** with a single call. You can set multiple fields in one call.

For each requested resource below, pick or generate **one** value and include it in a single `Simulation_Draft` call.

{% if 'names' in resources %}
**Names:** Generate ONE clear, descriptive simulation name. Include `name` in the draft call.
{% endif %}
{% if 'descriptions' in resources %}
**Descriptions:** Write ONE description of the simulation's flow, learning objectives, and pacing. Include `description` in the draft call.
{% endif %}
{% if 'scenarios' in resources %}
**Scenarios:** Select relevant scenario IDs from Simulation_Get. Include `scenario_ids` (list) in the draft call.
{% endif %}
{% if 'scenario_positions' in resources %}
**Scenario Positions:** Set the ordering of scenarios. Include `scenario_positions` (list of {scenario_id, position}) in the draft call.
{% endif %}
{% if 'scenario_flags' in resources %}
**Scenario Flags:** Set per-scenario flags. Include `scenario_flags` (list of {scenario_id, flag_id}) in the draft call.
{% endif %}
{% if 'scenario_rubrics' in resources %}
**Scenario Rubrics:** Bind a rubric per scenario. Include `scenario_rubrics` (list of {scenario_id, rubric_id}) in the draft call.
{% endif %}
{% if 'scenario_time_limits' in resources %}
**Scenario Time Limits:** Set a time limit per scenario. Include `scenario_time_limits` (list of {scenario_id, seconds}) in the draft call.
{% endif %}
{% if 'flags' in resources %}
**Flags:** Pass `flag_ids` (a list of flag option UUIDs) to set simulation state. Include the simulation_active flag's `id` from Simulation_Get to make it available.
