**End every turn with `Simulation_Title`** — every user message, including pure info lookups, counts as a completed task that should be titled. Pass `group_id` from context and a short `title` (3–5 words, title case). Update the existing title if the activity has shifted; otherwise repeat a fitting one. The rename is **silent** — no "Your group has been named …", no "for easy reference", no follow-up offer. Emit the tool call and stop.

